<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34609" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμφέρω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bear</i> or <i>bring in</i> (v. infr. <i><span class="en">
				11
			</span></i>):—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be borne</i> or <i>carried in</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔν τινι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Epid.</u>
					7.40
				</span></i>
			 (vulg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκφ.</span>)
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">; δίναις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					4.613
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βένθεσι πόντου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Opp.
					<u>H.</u>
					1.81
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, <i>carry with oneself</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arat.
				701
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>enter in</i> an account, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν λήμυατι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PEleph.</u>
					15.4
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>:—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνεφέρετο</span>
			<i>an account was given</i>, Gloss.ad <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				14.12
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <i>to be contained</i> in, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἶδος ἐ. γένει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.460
				</span></i>
			, al.: abs., <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				2.1
			</span></i>,al.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἐμφερόμενα τῷ πράγματι</span>
			<i>matters appertaining to</i> the subject, <i><span class="en">
				Longin.
				12.2
			</span></i>, prob.in <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				10.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμφέρεσθαι τῇ αἰτίᾳ,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνέχεσθαι</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12(3).174.12
			</span></i> (Astypalaea, Epist.Aug.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ
				ἐμφερόμενος</span> the party <i>concerned,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				CPHerm.
				53.12
			</span></i> (pl., <span class="entity">iii A. D.</span>), etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμφέρω</span>, Thess., 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰσφέρω</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				9(2).205
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				20
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Melitaea</span>); also, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰσφέρω</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				1.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Berl.Sitzb.</u>
				1927.8
			</span></i> (
				Locr.
			, V. B.C.).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
